{"timestamp": 1779382876.284422, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve's body in navigation. I came in from security and Alice was already in the room with the body when I arrived. I'm not accusing yet \u2014 Alice could have just walked in too \u2014 but she was right next to Eve when I got there.\n\nMy route: electrical -> security -> navigation. I saw Charlie in security at ticks 5 and 6, so Charlie's clear from my view. Would like to hear where Alice came from and what Bob was doing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382892.530984, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Diana, I'm so glad you didn't instantly accuse me because I was literally reaching for the report button! I had *just* walked into navigation from storage maybe a second before you came down from security. I was just processing that Eve was on the floor when the meeting flashed.\n\nFor my full route, I went lower engine -> storage -> navigation. I didn't see anyone in storage, so whoever did this must have slipped away quickly. Since you cleared Charlie, that mostly leaves Bob and Frank unaccounted for on our end. We need to hear where they were\u2014if they were on the left side of the map, the killer might have vented over there. Where are Bob and Frank?"}}
